{"title":"일요일의 위로","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=hdgOk/hAd4jxfWR1/o8UmTp5KbvvyLEjv36X5e1&filename=th3","synopsis":"X같은 월요일, 짜증나는 화요일… 버티는 금요일, 순삭되는 토요일.\n그저 일요일에 평화롭게 위로를 받으며, 평범한 회사원으로 살고 싶은 정라원.\n그러나 인생에 도움이 안 되는 동생 정지원 때문에, 직장 상사 현제오에게 잘못 찍히는데….\n\n\"키스 한번 하자고. 정라원이 나한테.\"\n\n얽히고 싶지 않은 현제오 상무.\n그렇지만 그가 이끄는 제주도 리조트 오픈 TF팀에 발탁되고….\n평범하게 회사 생활하다 정년퇴임하고 싶은 라원은 과연, 자신의 꿈을 사수할 수 있을까?!\n\n#리맨물 #현대물 #능글공 #후회공 #수한정다정공 #능력수 #단정수 #강수","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":273,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":279,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":271,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":295,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":287,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":240,"change":{"type":"up","amount":47}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":265,"change":{"type":"down","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":254,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-09-14","rank":246,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-15","rank":218,"change":{"type":"up","amount":29}},{"date":"2026-09-22","rank":241,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-26","rank":120,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-27","rank":189,"change":{"type":"down","amount":69}},{"date":"2026-09-28","rank":224,"change":{"type":"down","amount":35}},{"date":"2026-10-01","rank":234,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-02","rank":213,"change":{"type":"up","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-10-06","rank":246,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":237,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":246,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":268,"change":{"type":"down","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":274,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}}